Package: pecorename
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: batch file renamer for V\OS
 PecoRename renames many files at once from a previewable list: search
 and replace, insert/overwrite, numbering, upper/lower case, extensions,
 dates and random patterns, with a conflict check and a report before
 anything is applied. Files arrive by drag and drop or the Tracker
 context menu.
